## Overview

I advised Forge part-time from 2013 to 2016, then joined as Product Design Manager. I led design direction, projects, and the roadmap while managing two designers.

We worked on an iteration of the Forge Windows desktop app and updated the company's visual identity. The work shown here includes logo sketches, the mark and wordmark, color, and app states for notifications, promotion, sharing, settings, and stream overlay themes.
